+		// cluster buffer). Compute stages keep read_write for actual writes.
+		//
+		// Demotion would also be wrong for a buffer that is read in vertex and
+		// written in fragment; no such buffer exists in the renderer, and a
+		// read_write Storage BGL entry has its vertex visibility stripped below.
